5px-Shar_Symbol.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4b/Shar_Symbol.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Church_of_Shar\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Church of Shar\">Church of Shar</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Common\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: Common</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.5 kg (1 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.5 kg (1 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 500 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  500  gp</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Looted from or pickpocketed from <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mirie\" title=\"Mirie\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/19/Portrait_Mirie.png/25px-Portrait_Mirie.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/19/Portrait_Mirie.png/38px-Portrait_Mirie.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/19/Portrait_Mirie.png/50px-Portrait_Mirie.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mirie\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/19/Portrait_Mirie.png/25px-Portrait_Mirie.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/19/Portrait_Mirie.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mirie\" title=\"Mirie\">Mirie</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Grief\" title=\"House of Grief\">House of Grief</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[A self-help tome, claiming to help those prone to jealousy.]\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>Do you covet what others have, while neglecting what you already lay claim to? Does your desire for more curdle into a mire of self-pity? You must prise yourself from the fetid swamp of jealousy, before it drowns you. Think not of what others have, but what they do not have. There is joy to be found in helping others. Joy - and perhaps salvation also.\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>[The book continues on at great length, suggesting treatments pioneered by the <a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Grief\" title=\"House of Grief\">House of Grief</a> may help, should self-improvement fail.]\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715023527\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.041 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.042 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1599/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 20140/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6375/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.005/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 881494/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   32.634      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   32.634      1 -total\n 41.89%   13.670      7 Template:Icon_text\n 32.54%   10.620     15 Template:Trim\n 20.93%    6.831      3 Template:Icon_link\n 19.52%    6.370      1 Template:Main_only\n 13.79%    4.502      1 Template:PageSeo\n 13.79%    4.499      2 Template:CharLink\n 13.59%    4.434      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 13.26%    4.326      1 Template:Ifexist\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:43671-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715023527 and revision id 330483. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}